WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.806
This video shows where a run writes the

00:00:02.806 --> 00:00:05.520
nitrogen and the phosphorus that leave the
land.

00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:10.947
The run of this video is the run of Run
streamflow:

00:00:10.947 --> 00:00:17.130
the basin 02070002, 2000 to 2015, with a
warm-up of three years.

00:00:17.330 --> 00:00:19.580
The page draws no chart of nutrients,

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:22.680
so this chapter reads the tables of the
run folder.

00:00:23.182 --> 00:00:27.616
The run of Run streamflow already wrote
the tables of this chapter by month,

00:00:27.616 --> 00:00:29.542
by year and for the average year.

00:00:30.042 --> 00:00:31.411
The row Entire basin,

00:00:31.411 --> 00:00:35.519
Sediment and nutrients gives the nutrients
that leave the land,

00:00:35.519 --> 00:00:38.062
as the mean over the land of the basin.

00:00:38.564 --> 00:00:43.514
The row HRUs, Sediment and nutrients gives
the same for each HRU.

00:00:44.016 --> 00:00:48.038
The row Entire basin, Nutrient balance
gives what the land gains

00:00:48.038 --> 00:00:50.866
and what moves between the pools of the
soil.

00:00:51.368 --> 00:00:54.482
Every value of these tables is an amount

00:00:54.482 --> 00:00:57.908
for one ha of land in the step of the
table:

00:00:57.908 --> 00:01:01.178
kg of nitrogen or kg of phosphorus per ha.

00:01:01.678 --> 00:01:04.038
In Results, click Open output folder.

00:01:08.633 --> 00:01:11.813
The output folder of the run now holds
these tables.

00:01:12.330 --> 00:01:15.970
The chapter prints the losses and the
gains of each printed year.
